    {
      "target": "약속을 안 지켜서 섭섭하다.",
      "reading": "yaksokeul an jikyeoseo seopseophada.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "I'm disappointed because you didn't keep the promise.",
        "ko": "약속을 안 지켜서 섭섭하다.",
        "ipa": "yaksokeul an jikyeoseo seopseophada.",
        "ar": "أنا منزعج لأنك لم تفي بالوعد.",
        "cs": "Mrzí mě to, protože jsi nesplnil slib.",
        "da": "Jeg er skuffet, fordi du ikke holdt dit løfte.",
